# Active JD scratch file is local-only; ship _TEMPLATE_ version instead
jobs/paste_job_description_here.md

# Job-specific PDFs must not land in outputs/. Only the canonical sample resume is tracked.
outputs/*
!outputs/Rithwik_Gokhale_Resume.pdf
